      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Starting from invisibility requires securing safe havens and cultivating monks or scholars who recognize your hereditary worth as the true ones. You must establish a network of trusted allies across the world and slowly develop your presence through charitable works and murals in the shadows. Although politics often accelerate change, your secondcoming efforts demand patience, silence, and the strategic use of secrecy to prepare the ground for a future restoration.",
